name: sim.yprToAbg
description: Converts Yaw-Pitch-Roll angles to CoppeliaSim's alpha-beta-gamma angles
luaSynopsis: list outAngles = sim.yprToAbg(list inAngles)
pythonSynopsis: float[3] outAngles = sim.yprToAbg(float[3] inAngles)
inputs:
1. inAngles: 3 angles: yaw, pitch and roll
outputs:
1. outAngles: 3 angles: alpha, beta and gamma
replacedBy:
- use simEigen methods
